  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kwanele! Communities ensuring safe learning environments for girls.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Soul City Institute (SCI) and Grassroots Soccer (GRS) SA will work in 20 different schools in the Western Cape combining the SCI approach centred on after school Soul Buddyz clubs for children combined with the GRS SA approach which utilises soccer for both girls and boys. The activities proposed through both clubs and sport will help girls to reject violence, boys to behave differently, parents to better support the process and schools and communities to be safer places for all children.</narrative>
  </description>
